===== luhn_check 280
147 | Start at the rightmost digit and move left: leave the Nst digit as it is, double the Nnd, leave the Nrd, double the Nth, and so on. Whenever a doubled digit is more than N, subtract N from it. Add up all the results. A number is valid if the total is a multiple of N. One more digit is to be written at the right end of N so that the new number is valid (the digit written there is the rightmost digit of the new number). Which digit must be written?
133 | Start at the rightmost digit and move left: leave the Nst digit as it is, double the Nnd, leave the Nrd, double the Nth, and so on. Whenever a doubled digit is more than N, subtract N from it. Add up all the results. The number is valid if the total is a multiple of N. Is the number N valid? Answer yes or no.
